{"mode":"words","text":"Şimdi metni dinlerken aynı anda okuyacaksın. Başlangıç seviyesindeyken, ana dilinde anlam satırını okuyacak, hedef dili yavaşça dinleyecek ve sık sık duraklat düğmesine basacaksın — böylece beynin ses ile anlamı birbirine bağlayacak. İleri seviye bir öğrenciysen, orijinal metni okur ve sadece bilmediğin kelimelerde kısaca aşağıya bakarsın. Bu sırada sık sık A-B tekrarı yöntemini kullan: Tek bir cümleyi seç ve onu döngü halinde dinle — yukarıda dene.","words":[{"s":0,"e":650},{"s":952,"e":1358},{"s":1416,"e":2125},{"s":2206,"e":2461},{"s":2519,"e":2752},{"s":2798,"e":3843},{"s":4180,"e":4888},{"s":4934,"e":6153},{"s":6455,"e":6734},{"s":6803,"e":7221},{"s":7291,"e":7674},{"s":7779,"e":8313},{"s":8371,"e":9195},{"s":9451,"e":9868},{"s":9938,"e":10159},{"s":10205,"e":10704},{"s":10786,"e":11540},{"s":11842,"e":12040},{"s":12144,"e":12364},{"s":12434,"e":12643},{"s":12713,"e":13282},{"s":13305,"e":13862},{"s":13920,"e":14977},{"s":15128,"e":15174},{"s":15638,"e":16231},{"s":16300,"e":16730},{"s":16846,"e":17136},{"s":17217,"e":17438},{"s":17519,"e":17995},{"s":18053,"e":18692},{"s":18750,"e":19690},{"s":20422,"e":20863},{"s":20933,"e":21385},{"s":21443,"e":21618},{"s":21722,"e":22953},{"s":23255,"e":23951},{"s":24021,"e":24416},{"s":24485,"e":24984},{"s":25379,"e":25565},{"s":25635,"e":26204},{"s":26273,"e":26865},{"s":26935,"e":27736},{"s":27806,"e":28305},{"s":28444,"e":29094},{"s":29152,"e":30104},{"s":30639,"e":30848},{"s":30917,"e":31358},{"s":31440,"e":31718},{"s":31858,"e":32229},{"s":32694,"e":33100},{"s":33286,"e":33878},{"s":33936,"e":34528},{"s":34586,"e":35294},{"s":35921,"e":36200},{"s":36270,"e":36455},{"s":36514,"e":37001},{"s":37106,"e":37500},{"s":37895,"e":38069},{"s":38151,"e":38406},{"s":38464,"e":38882},{"s":38940,"e":39544},{"s":39602,"e":40194},{"s":40240,"e":40287},{"s":40542,"e":41099},{"s":41158,"e":41796}]}